    },
    {
      "id": "claim_16929e4192694f9e88e21b2df6f1eb58",
      "statement": "default_model_pair() is the deployment-level terminal fallback: it reads LLM_MODEL_ID and LLM_REASONING_EFFORT, validates that the resulting model is supported and default-eligible, and raises ValueError for an unsupported model or effort.",
