    {
      "id": "claim_6542ad2cef5747e9b221dffc6d2cf2e0",
      "statement": "For a hosted agent run, the factory seeds team main/subagent defaults, applies a profile only when no stored thread model exists, then uses stored thread settings when present; a valid explicit configurable agent_model_id/agent_effort replaces that snapshot and the resolved settings are persisted back to the thread.",
